   "text": "Queries missing from both published files, scored 0: d2bbva_, d3bvxa1, d3bvxa2, d3bvxa3, d3cu7a6, d3ljqa_, d6a1ia1, g1apy.1, g1b35.1, g1f8v.1, g1gk9.1, g1k2x.1, g1ku8.1, g1o7d.1, g1o7d.2, g1o7d.3, g1or0.1, g1pvc.1, g1q7l.1, g1qqp.1, g1r8o.1, g1tme.1, g2a73.1, g2dbx.1. With the denominator over only the domains that can be found (no extra 1), the superfamily AUC would be 0.638 for Foldseek and 0.204 for MMseqs2; both are kept in data/scope40_long.parquet (sensitivity_possible)."
